{"ticker":"NOW","updated":"2026-10-23T23:23:06Z","profile":{"longName":"ServiceNow, Inc.","shortName":"ServiceNow, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.servicenow.com","fullTimeEmployees":29187,"marketCap":164342710272,"trailingPE":99.350006,"forwardPE":31.759796,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":11.155492,"pegRatio":1.13,"targetMeanPrice":156.53609,"targetHighPrice":266.0,"targetLowPrice":72.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":46,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.24,"earningsGrowth":-0.219,"grossMargins":0.74768996,"operatingMargins":0.04063,"profitMargins":0.11336,"totalRevenue":14732000256,"beta":0.99,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":192.966,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":81.24,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"ServiceNow, Inc. provides cloud-based solution for digital workflows in the North America, Brazil, Europe, the Middle East and Africa, Asia Pacific, and internationally. The company provides asset management, integrated risk management, IT service management, Operational Technology management, Security Operations, strategic portfolio management, IT operations management products; customer service management product; field service management applications; and sales and order management services. It also offers human resources delivery; legal and contract operations; workplace service delivery products; app engine product; automation engine; platform privacy and security product; and source-to-pay operations. In addition, the company provides RaptorDB, a database built to manage workloads at scale; ServiceNow Impact that provides customers with software tools, guided plans, and AI-driven recommendations; customer support; and workflow data fabric. It serves government, financial services, healthcare and life science, manufacturing, Public Sector, retail, technology, and Telecom sectors through service providers and resale partners. The company has a strategic collaboration with Cohesity, Inc. to develop, operate, and safeguard autonomous AI agents and data with enterprise-grade reliability; and with ServiceNow to Advance Ai-Powered Solution for Mission-Critical Infrastructure Mon","summary_zh":"ServiceNow, Inc. 為北美、巴西、歐洲、中東和非洲、亞太地區以及國際範圍內的數位工作流程提供基於雲端的解決方案。公司提供資產管理、綜合風險管理、IT服務管理、營運技術管理、安全營運、策略組合管理、IT營運管理產品；客戶服務管理產品；現場服務管理應用程式；以及銷售和訂單管理服務。它還提供人力資源交付；合法和合約營運；工作場所服務交付產品；應用引擎產品；自動化引擎；平台隱私和安全產品；以及從來源到付款的操作。此外，該公司還提供 RaptorDB，這是一個為大規模管理工作負載而構建的資料庫；ServiceNow Impact 為客戶提供軟體工具、指導計劃和人工智慧驅動的建議；客戶支援；和工作流程資料結構。它透過服務提供者和轉售合作夥伴為政府、金融服務、醫療保健和生命科學、製造、公共部門、零售、技術和電信部門提供服務。該公司與 Cohesity, Inc. 建立策略合作，開發、營運和保護具有企業級可靠性的自主人工智慧代理和資料；並與 ServiceNow 共同推進關鍵任務基礎設施的人工智慧解決方案","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":177.942,"h":178.034,"l":175.738,"c":175.988,"v":4306000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":175.8,"h":176.0,"l":171.016,"c":172.932,"v":13418500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":174.334,"h":177.922,"l":173.64,"c":177.596,"v":6011000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":178.1,"h":187.156,"l":177.948,"c":185.72,"v":15218000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":185.852,"h":186.798,"l":181.942,"c":183.492,"v":9409000},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":180.354,"h":182.85,"l":178.928,"c":182.284,"v":6239000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":181.798,"h":184.268,"l":178.902,"c":183.876,"v":6690500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":181.896,"h":182.046,"l":175.638,"c":179.712,"v":8519500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":180.83,"h":183.24,"l":180.27,"c":182.76,"v":6419500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":183.028,"h":188.964,"l":182.512,"c":187.866,"v":8180500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":189.0,"h":189.0,"l":185.56,"c":186.734,"v":5988000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":187.2,"h":188.984,"l":183.866,"c":184.714,"v":8243000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":185.544,"h":188.534,"l":184.73,"c":187.656,"v":5865000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":188.346,"h":188.37,"l":185.386,"c":185.792,"v":3555500},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":186.09,"h":191.234,"l":185.946,"c":189.484,"v":7730500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":188.142,"h":189.288,"l":185.694,"c":186.402,"v":6501